{"id":"vod_bf_169306","vodId":"169306","provider":"bf","providerName":"暴风资源","type":2,"name":"麦克斯奥特曼","name_cn":"麦克斯奥特曼","date":"2005-01-01","year":"2005","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"完结","images":{"common":"https://p.bfvp26.com/upload/vod/20261024-1/17b82c92d8cc402b1cb3449d32daaeb0.webp"},"summary":"进入21世纪，世界各地灾难频发，更有各种空想怪物惊现世间，引出无数的灾难，而人类文明也面临覆灭的危险。在这个关键时刻，DASH小组的热血青年男女站在人类的最前端，以他们微弱的力量包围着地球。充满正义感的青年东马快斗（青山草太 饰）志愿加入DASH，可是却未能通过相关测验。某天，两只怪兽现身日本，并相互缠斗。危难当前，地球人得到来自M798星云的正义使者麦克斯奥特曼的帮助。新世纪的正义与邪恶的战争由此拉开序幕…… 本系列39话共集结了金子修介、八木毅、実相寺昭雄、梶研吾等11名导演和NAKA雅MURA等在内的18名编剧共同完成。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2026-10-24 19:19:35","playable":true,"episodeCount":39,"playGroups":[{"name":"bfzym3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第1集","url":"https://v.fengbao14.com/video/maikesiaoteman/08ab92a1b910/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第2集","url":"https://v.fengbao14.com/video/maikesiaoteman/546613a24c3f/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第3集","url":"https://v.fengbao14.com/video/maikesiaoteman/a33542eb5f53/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第4集","url":"https://v.fengbao14.com/video/maikesiaoteman/22381cfd4b9e/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第5集","url":"https://v.fengbao14.com/video/maikesiaoteman/2347abc6a99e/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第6集","url":"https://v.fengbao14.com/video/maikesiaoteman/99cdd48e7223/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第7集","url":"https://v.fengbao14.com/video/maikesiaoteman/cfa9da5646ff/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第8集","url":"https://v.fengbao14.com/video/maikesiaoteman/5636721e8919/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第9集","url":"https://v.fengbao14.com/video/maikesiaoteman/5757372fbd0b/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v.fengbao14.com/video/maikesiaoteman/67f9289ffbb9/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v.fengbao14.com/video/maikesiaoteman/253d4060cd68/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v.fengbao14.com/video/maikesiaoteman/7d4e0b10cb3c/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://v.fengbao14.com/video/maikesiaoteman/4d4fb2860490/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","ur